            "review_text": "Em0802736\nDubbo, Australia14 contributions\n0\nPerfect find in District 1!\nOct 2019 • Couples\nCertainly an awesome find in District 1! \n\nI’m a bit of a skeptical eater when it comes to dining in foreign countries - however when my husband pointed out the awesome street front of Gaxeo we couldn’t resist! \n\nGreat staff, amazing food and an awesome relaxed atmosphere. \n\nRecommend to only go small portions if you’re ordering for yourself. Jack Daniels chicken is world class!\nRead more\nWritten October 30, 2019",
