            "review_text": "StewMarshall\nRandwick, Australia26 contributions\n0\nLunch option\nApr 2019 • Friends\nIf you are in district 1 and looking for a cheaper lunch option for the kids, this is it. \nThis is a Korean Meat on the Vietnamese Bahn Mi. We fed 9, 4 adults and 5 kids. Everyone had a roll, chips and a drink. About AU$3 each. \nI’m writing this a few days after the fact & no side affects. Taste was awesome. Service was pretty good. The language barrier was the only problem, however, all meals came out at the same time. Fresh and what we ordered. Not a massive culinary delight. But, for a fast food option, quite palatable. As I said earlier, good for the kids. Ours, aged 10 to 16.\nRead more\nWritten May 1, 2019",
