            "review_text": "Lauren\nMelbourne, Australia91 contributions\n0\nFried chicken super crispy and big portions\nDec 2017 • Couples\nI am not a huge chicken fiend myself but my husband is and he loved it here. The chicken I had to say was the crispiest I had ever tasted. Also not oily at all which was a surprise. For me I would have liked a few more smaller dishes on the menu as I don’t have the stomach for mountains of friend chicken. \n\nService there is super friendly and fast. The price is higher than other chicken places around but I think the quality speaks for itself!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2017",
