            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nFast growing KFC (Korean Fried Chicken) chain\nSep 2017 • Family\nSlightly more expensive than the regular players in the market, but nonetheless growing fast and opening so quickly, and in prime areas too - seems like they've six outlets now in just a year or two?! Amazing. We think they do have a good winning formula:\n\n1. food - their grilled, fried and cheese hotplate versions are all yums\n2. decor - that scandi-industrial look&feel is both cool and inviting\n3. locations - highly visible be it in downtown or expat areas - smart.\n4. promotions - 80,000vnd lunch sets are affordable to attract new cx\n\nLove the accompanying grilled vegs and whole garlics. Those who like good beers will be pleased that they've some craft beers as well.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 28, 2017",
